      "height": 0,
      "content": "Screens for the canvas-size work (docs/work/2026-10-28-canvas-size/shaping.md). Imports quadra.lib.pen. Padding is added around the final output, after resize, in exact px. Frames, left to right: Base · Editor (copy of quadra.pen's Alt · Editor layout, wired to the library); 1 · Output padding, locked (PNG): rail button Canvas active, one All sides field, transparent background on the checkerboard; 2 · Output padding, per side (JPG): T/R/B/L fields, solid color background, white by default in JPG."
